  "canonical_role": "This entry traces resurrection from Daniel’s vision to Gospel narratives, apostolic proclamation, letters, and Revelation. It helps readers distinguish the narrated resurrection of Jesus, the promised raising of believers, and the wider hope of renewed creation.",
